---
/**
 * Home — Intro
 * Figma: "2 intro" (10093:145), 1728×1012
 * https://www.figma.com/design/9SsfbCUY7KcxjZpCuRpDxf/Hello-Robo-Website-2026?node-id=10093-145
 */
---
<section class="home-intro">
  <img
    class="home-intro__stamp"
    src="/images/home/stamp-intro.svg"
    alt=""
    width="342"
    height="144"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <p class="home-intro__text t-h3">
    Hello Robo designs the human side of robotics — turning complex systems into products operators trust, teams ship, and investors notice.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .home-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    /* stamp at 213, text at 390, block 1012 tall */
    padding-top: 213px;
    padding-bottom: 390px;
    gap: 33px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .home-intro__stamp {
    width: 342px;
    height: auto;
  }
  /* Figma box is 807; browsers set Alliance ~1% tighter, 795 reproduces Figma's line breaks */
  .home-intro__text {
    width: 795px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
</style>
